  id: W5_06
  era: 1947
  title: Partition, August 1947
  text: "Partition, August 1947. Independence came with the partition of British India into India and Pakistan. Around fifteen million people crossed the new borders in Punjab and Bengal, and the violence claimed hundreds of thousands of lives \u2013 some estimates say up to two million. It was one of the largest migrations in human history. Many families who lived through Partition have recorded their memories, so that the human cost of these events is not forgotten."
